<%
  ttl = @expires_in.presence || NetworkInvitationMailer::INVITE_TOKEN_TTL
  valid_for = email_duration_label(ttl)
  expires_at = @expires_at.presence || (Time.current + ttl.to_i)
  expires_at_label = email_expiration_timestamp(expires_at)
%>
<% content_for :email_footer_note, "Once you register using this link, your company will automatically connect with #{@inviter_company_name}. This invitation expires in #{valid_for} (#{expires_at_label})." %>
YOU'RE INVITED TO TAX FORM HUB

<% if @company_name.present? %>
<%= @inviter_company_name %> invited <%= @company_name %> to connect on Tax Form Hub.
<% else %>
<%= @inviter_company_name %> invited you to connect on Tax Form Hub.
<% end %>

Invited By: <%= @inviter_company_name %>
<% if @company_name.present? %>Company: <%= @company_name %>
<% end %>Invitation Valid For: <%= valid_for %>
Expires At: <%= expires_at_label %>
<% if @personal_message.present? %>

Personal Note from <%= @inviter_company_name %>:
<%= @personal_message %>
<% end %>

Create your account and connect automatically using the link below:
<%= @signup_url %>

Invitation Expiration:
This invitation link is valid for <%= valid_for %> and expires on <%= expires_at_label %>. If it expires before you sign up, ask <%= @inviter_company_name %> to send you a new invitation.
